   signature standard; digital signature standard; key encapsulation
   mechanism (KEM); key encapsulation mechanism (KEM); polynomial
   arithmetic architecture; polynomial arithmetic architecture; secure hash
   algorithm; secure hash algorithm; secure hash algorithm},
