Affiliation = {Zhang, J (Corresponding Author), Hong Kong Univ Sci \& Technol, Dept Elect \& Comp Engn, Hong Kong, Peoples R China.
   Mao, Yuyi; Huang, Kaibin, Hong Kong Polytech Univ, Dept Elect \& Elect Engn, Hong Kong, Peoples R China.
